# Stock TB-J706F S620150 /vendor/etc/init/hw/init.target.rc, with these changes:
# - services removed whose binaries the vendor does not ship (sec_nvm, spdaemon, ppd/mm-pp-dpps,
#   qfp-daemon, energy-awareness: absent from stock too; hbtp_daemon: dropped, no HBTP driver;
#   the disabled context hub HAL: dropped, no CHRE daemon);
# - kernel modules loaded under the file names of the source-built kernel (stock audio_X.ko is
#   X_dlkm.ko, audio_machine_talos.ko is machine_dlkm.ko, qca_cld3_wlan.ko is wlan.ko; the
#   module names inside the files are the same);
# - no read-write mount of the lenovocust partition on /lenovocust.
#
